# deepmerge-ts; it is used internally by @prisma/config for merging Prisma configuration.
# Upgrade path: fix available (deepmerge-ts >=8.0.0). Consider running `npm audit fix`.
# App risk: LOW — no user-controlled input reaches deepmerge-ts; config merging only.
GHSA-ggr8-5vv4-36mx
#
# Source: serialize-javascript (via @ducanh2912/next-pwa -> workbox-build -> @rollup/plugin-terser)
# Justification: serialize-javascript RCE (via RegExp.flags/Date.toISOString) and DoS
