# worker bundling. No runtime deserialization of untrusted serialized data occurs.
# Upgrade path: no fixed version available (<=7.0.4 affected). Blocked by workbox-build.
# App risk: LOW — build-time only; no runtime deserialization of untrusted input.
GHSA-5c6j-r48x-rmvq
GHSA-qj8w-gfj5-8c6v
