# import braces/micromatch/fast-glob itself.
# Upgrade path: no fixed version available (braces <=3.0.3 affected; 3.0.3 is latest).
# App risk: LOW — build-time only; no runtime glob expansion of user input.
GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm
